{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後", "occurrences": 10, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "侯", "id": "侯"}, {"form": "力", "id": "力"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "召", "id": "召"}, {"form": "庶", "id": "庶"}, {"form": "役", "id": "役"}, {"form": "往", "id": "往"}, {"form": "招", "id": "招"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "禦", "id": "禦"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "諸", "id": "諸"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.4150437744058764, "source": "庶", "target": "召"}, {"weight": 2.513656063073986, "source": "庶", "target": "役"}, {"weight": 1.9540402751385635, "source": "庶", "target": "往"}, {"weight": 1.4150437744058764, "source": "庶", "target": "招"}, {"weight": 3.0244816868399766, "source": "役", "target": "召"}, {"weight": 3.563478187572664, "source": "役", "target": "往"}, {"weight": 2.8703310070127186, "source": "役", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.8491287993621155, "source": "諸", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 2.4183458832696614, "source": "諸", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 1.725198702709716, "source": "諸", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.8587300953342387, "source": "諸", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.1952023319554517, "source": "諸", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 2.0128807751614968, "source": "諸", "target": "禦"}, {"weight": 1.5020551513955063, "source": "諸", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 2.3313345062800317, "source": "招", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 1.771718718344609, "source": "招", "target": "往"}, {"weight": 0.45953232937844013, "source": "侯", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 2.028148247292285, "source": "侯", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 1.55814461804655, "source": "侯", 